    sol: "One process bubble: 'Order Processing System.' External entities: Customer (sends order data in, receives order confirmation out), Payment Gateway (receives payment request, sends payment confirmation back), Warehouse System (receives fulfillment instructions, sends shipment confirmation back). No internal processes/data stores are shown at this level — the context diagram exists purely to show the system's boundary and what crosses it.",
