    lvl: "med",
    q: "Document a business rule (in if/then format) and its related functional requirement, separately, for this scenario: VIP customers get free shipping on all orders.",
    sol: "Business rule: 'IF a customer's account is flagged VIP THEN no shipping fee is applied to their order, regardless of order value.' Functional requirement: 'The system must check the customer's VIP flag at checkout and, if true, set the shipping fee line item to $0.00 before calculating the order total, and must display \"(VIP free shipping applied)\" on the order summary.'",
    exp: "Keeping the rule and the requirement separate means if the VIP criteria change later (e.g. a new VIP tier with a different shipping benefit), the rule can be updated once without needing to rewrite every requirement that references it.",
