    lvl: "easy",
    q: "List the requirement attributes you'd track for this requirement: 'The system must allow an admin to deactivate a user account.' Fill in plausible sample values.",
    sol: "ID: REQ-078. Description: System allows an admin to deactivate a user account. Source: Security/Compliance stakeholder. Priority: Must have. Status: Approved. Owner: Security lead (approval authority for changes). Rationale: supports compliance requirement to promptly revoke access for offboarded employees.",
    exp: "Attributes turn a single requirement into something queryable/manageable across a whole set — without them you can't answer 'show me all Must-have security requirements still unimplemented' at scale.",
